# In the fight: a call, and a man who answers it. Chosen after the squad has
# decided (Squad), each by its situation.

== status_check
when: combat, situation:status
cast: A = rank>=2; B = hurt
cooldown: 20s
again: yes
A [shouts]: {B}! Are you standing?
B {if hurt>0.6}: He's cut me! I'm still here!
B {if craven}: I'm bleeding! Gods, I'm bleeding!
B: Standing! Come on!

== not_there
when: combat, dead>=1, situation:excuse
cast: A = rank>=2; B = craven
cooldown: 1m
A [shouts]: {B}, round his left!
B: Not there! That's where {dead} fell!

== no_way_round
when: combat, situation:excuse
cast: A = any; B = craven
cooldown: 1m
A [shouts]: {B}! Get behind him!
B: There's no way round! He'll have me!

== spotted_ask
when: situation:spotted_ask
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Anyone see him?
B {if craven}: Don't ask me! I'm not looking!
B: He went {place}!

== spotted_ask_quiet
when: situation:spotted_ask
cast: A = any; B = sly
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Where is he? Anyone?
B: Last I saw, {place}. Quietly now.

== man_down
when: situation:man_down
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 20s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Man down! {dead}'s down!
B {if craven}: That's two! That's two of us!
B: Keep together! Don't let him pick us off!

== man_down_rage
when: situation:man_down
cast: A = any; B = rash
cooldown: 20s
again: yes
A [shouts]: He got {dead}!
B: Then I'll have his head for it!

== tactic_envelop
when: situation:tactic_envelop
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Surround him! Box him in!
B {if craven}: You go round! I'll hold here!
B: Going round!

== tactic_press
when: situation:tactic_press
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: He's bleeding! Press him!
B {if rash}: Leave him to me!
B: Now! All of us!

== tactic_break
when: situation:tactic_break
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: He's hiding behind his blade! Break it!
B {if kind(brute)}: Out of my way.
B: Smash his guard!

== tactic_rush
when: situation:tactic_rush
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Close in! Don't let him shoot!
B: Rushing him!

== tactic_fall_back
when: situation:tactic_fall_back
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Fall back! To me!
B {if rash}: Fall back yourself!
B: Coming!

== tactic_rout
when: situation:tactic_rout
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Run! Get help!
B: Every man for himself!

== last_man
when: situation:last_man
cast: A = any; B? = any
cooldown: 1m
again: yes
A [shouts]: I'll fetch the others!
B: Go! I'll hold him!

== send_look
when: situation:send
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A [shouts]: {B}! Something {place}! Go and look!
B {if craven}: Me? Why always me?
B {if sly}: Going. Quietly.
B {if rash}: I'll have a look. And whatever's there.
B: Going!

== tactic_envelop_behind
when: situation:tactic_envelop
cast: A = any; B = sly
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Get round him!
B: I'll take his back.

== tactic_press_blood
when: situation:tactic_press
cast: A = any; B = craven
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: He's done for! Finish him!
B: You finish him! I'll watch!

== tactic_fall_back_gladly
when: situation:tactic_fall_back
cast: A = any; B = craven
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Regroup! Together!
B: Gladly!

== tactic_rout_captain
when: situation:tactic_rout
cast: A = any; B = stubborn
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Get out! Get help!
B: Go! I'll stand!

== spotted_ask_come_out
when: situation:spotted_ask
cast: A = any; B = rash
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Where'd he go?
B [shouts]: Come out! Come out and fight!

== man_down_close
when: situation:man_down
cast: A = any; B = stubborn
cooldown: 20s
again: yes
A [shouts]: {dead}'s down!
B: Close the gap! Close it!

== last_man_run
when: situation:last_man
cast: A = craven; B? = any
cooldown: 1m
again: yes
A [shouts]: I'm getting help! Hold him!
B: Hold him? With what?

== tactic_break_boot
when: situation:tactic_break
cast: A = any; B = rash
cooldown: 30s
again: yes
A [shouts]: Smash through his guard!
B: Watch this.
